"description":"98point6 by Transcarent provides on-demand consultation, diagnosis and treatment from board-certified clinicians and sends necessary prescriptions to your pharmacy—all via secure, in-app messaging. Our unique, text-based care delivery means you can get care conveniently, when and where you need it. No appointments, no travel. We're available nationwide, 24/7, 365 days a year. \n \n\nWHO IS TRANSCARENT? \nTranscarent is a health and care experience company that makes it easy for people to access high-quality, affordable health and care. The 98point6 by Transcarent app provides access to Transcarent’s on-demand virtual care clinic. \n \nHOW MUCH DOES IT COST? \nSome employers and health plans provide access to 98point6 by Transcarent at no charge and offer visits at low/no cost to eligible members and their dependents ages 1+. To see if you're eligible, please check with your health plan or employer. \nPlease note, the account holder must be 18+ to create an account and seek primary care; 19+ in Nebraska. \n \n\nWHO ARE YOUR DOCTORS? \nOur on-demand virtual clinic is staffed by carefully selected providers and board-certified physicians who are passionate about making care more accessible. Transcarent Clinic providers are specially trained to treat and diagnose via text-based care. (The 98point6 by Transcarent app supports photo, video and audio as needed.) \n \n\nWHAT CAN YOU TREAT? \nOur care team, including board-certified clinicians, are available on-demand to diagnose and treat, answer questions, offer peace of mind and when appropriate, guide you toward options for next steps.  \n \n\nCommon conditions we can treat or advise on include: \nCold, cough and flu \nUrinary tract infections (UTI) \nAcid reflux, heartburn and digestive issues \nDiagnosis and treatment via medications for anxiety and depression \nSkin conditions, rashes, bites and sunburn \nNausea, stomach flu and gastroenteritis \nGeneral health questions \nActivity and fitness \nNutrition and weight management \nWeight Health support and step counter for tracking physical activity \nStress management, relaxation, mental acuity \nDiseases and conditions management \nClinical Decision Support \nDisease prevention and public health \nHealthcare services and management \nMental and behavioral health \nMedical reference and education \nMedication and treatment management \nPhysical therapy and rehabilitation \nReproductive and sexual health \n...and more \n \n\nWHAT IS YOUR PRESCRIPTION POLICY? \nOur doctors can prescribe a wide variety of medications. However, we do not prescribe controlled substances (such as Percocet), muscle relaxants (such as Flexeril), lifestyle medications (such as Viagra or Propecia), weight loss medications (Ozempic or Wegovy) or medications that require strict monitoring. Our physicians adhere to evidence-based standards with respect to the responsible use of antibiotics. If we are unable to prescribe a medication, it's likely due to a combination of factors, including state and federal regulations related to virtual care practices, as well as what's in the best interest of patient safety and well-being. \n \n\nNote: 98point6 by Transcarent is not intended for medical emergencies. If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 or immediately go to the nearest emergency room.", "sellerUrl":"https://www.transcarent.com/", "releaseNotes":"New look and feel", "userRatingCount":50784}]
